[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_00_0010","text":"283事务所真奇怪呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_00_0020","text":"是吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_00_0030","text":"嗯，总觉得像家一样，对吧？\n这个房间也是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_00_0040","text":"确实，这里简直就像\n普通人家里的客厅一样呢——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_00_0005","text":"让人安心呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_00_0006","text":"待着很舒服呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_00_0007","text":"很奇怪呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_01_0010","text":"是啊\n虽然没什么时间好好待着就是了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_01_0020","text":"哈哈……\n我也差不多该结束休息了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_02_0010","text":"所以其他组合的人才\n经常聚在这里吧——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_02_0020","text":"也许吧\n你们俩也随便用"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_03_0010","text":"制作人也这么觉得？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07060000_03_0020","text":"真的，很奇怪呢——"}]
